Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyouka, I want to borrow Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should know what my\Nslave form is like, shouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't handle rewarding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want more weapons in my arsenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by her behavior in default form,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kusetsu was most likely a newborn\Namongst the eight thunder gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to assume that the remaining\Ngods are stronger than she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lives are at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuuki. We need to be\Nas strong as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason my life is this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know is all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:00:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were your words!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm okay with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want Mato to borrow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mato?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can change into something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense. Right. Up my alley!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.27,0:01:33.31,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs63\pos(1267.2,75.6)}Eternal Chains: Slave
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.27,0:01:33.31,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1324.8,151.2)\fs63}Thunderous Roar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.89,0:01:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go for a ride.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.98,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,140.4)\an7}Episode 12
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.98,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\fs87\an8}Gods Assemble
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good down there? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This speed is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The breeze in Mato isn't so bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always thought\Nmotorcycles were really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to learn how to ride one so\NI could take a girl out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've warmed up, let's see, what\Nkind of tricks you've got up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crew of Shuuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're not fans\Nof the noise, are they?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.27,0:02:42.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}My heart sunk and I no longer feel hope for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take these guys out!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.19,0:02:47.85,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}It felt like time froze and now it's all over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's rest things up a bit!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Brooding and silent
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.69,0:02:54.35,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Jiwari kokoro no kasa ga hiraita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run him over, Yuki!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.35,0:02:57.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}The umbrella of my heart began to open
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.52,0:03:02.27,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}I won't ask you to comfort me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one-hit kill!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.60,0:03:07.52,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}I want to grow strong and focus on what's ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You holding up okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.52,0:03:13.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}But weakness crushes me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.49,0:03:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's patrol the second squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.35,0:03:20.35,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Meeting you is what filled my world with light
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.65,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(172.8,129.6)}Demon Defense Force
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.65,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(192.0,205.2)}2nd Squadron Dorm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.35,0:03:25.23,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}I didn't have an ounce of hope, and yet I could laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.23,0:03:29.81,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Ordinary conversations always brought me a smile
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You held out all the way to the dorm!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}I won't say thanks 'cause you'll blush and laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can flush our enemies out\Nof hiding with all the noise!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.23,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}But I'm thinking it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.23,0:03:39.27,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Can I move forward from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strong and durable, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not too shabby.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.60,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}O light, come to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time for\Nyour reward to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a reward is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.23,0:04:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.06,0:04:15.81,Balloon Bold BT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1056.0,86.4)\an7}Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this isn't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, uh, thank you that's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why did I hand him my drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.61,0:04:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is almost like an indirect kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let, let me have yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really kicking my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there's still more to it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Nletting a man see me naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.53,0:05:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a real kiss, Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I go this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:06:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to accept the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad Mato is feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how my sister\Nand the others are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tenka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.79,0:06:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sis! Coco! Naon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love that I can feel my little\Nbrother's strength returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting to Yokohama and back\Nwas easy thanks to Tenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean there and back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brought her there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling when I discovered that\Nour enemy could face through matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured Alba and her friends\Nwere probably linked somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And boy, she hit the nail on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka's been bringing us all\Nsorts of goodies for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying solo is usually the best way to\Nminimize the risk involved. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it this way because I knew that\Nyou'd be worried for their well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Tenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Ms. Tenka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important to always\Nlook out for one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you a big thank\Nyou as well, so thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yukki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, it was all Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so modest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard about it from Aoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told us that it was\Ntruly quite the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnificent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyouka was the real hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.75,0:08:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka, got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the Demon Defense Force\Ngoing to show up on my doorstep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Defense Force is dealing\Nwith the threat of the Eight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thunder Gods and their new\Nmethod of deploying Shuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty swamped right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess even your organization\Nhas some adjustments to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.37,0:08:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still haven't found\Nany leads on turning
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and your friends back\Ninto humans quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep trying to probe for\Ninformation on the Onmio Bureau, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like it's going to take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be best if we move to a\Ndifferent hideout, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, just having Coco and now on\Nback safe and sound is a five-star rating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two feeling alright\Nnow that you're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we're not injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit lethargic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.63,0:09:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already improved a\Nlot since getting back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's something\NI can do to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give wonderful massages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their pressure points, the\Nins and outs of their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I know every part of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because Kuusetsu is inside\Nof me, and she was one with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like a brand new person!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All's well that ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I faced plenty of challenges\Nduring the Yokohama fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better lock in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you at the next\Ncommander's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Miss Tenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of Shuuki raining\Ndown on a big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world is in a giant uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making all those appearances, to put\Neveryone's mind at ease, must be very hectic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a great job. Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you can help me\Nblow off some steam later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Ren is always busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.27,0:11:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her work truly never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a young woman's game for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did good protecting the\Ncivilians, preventing pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The police department expressed\Ntheir gratitude as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All in a day's work for\Nthe Demon Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, this mission\Nproved a valuable point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commanders can have trouble\Nprotecting the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was a way to keep\Nall the fights here in Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Miss Yakumo could\Njoin in with her full powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander, now is the\Ntime to go on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The level of risk to\Nthe world has increased,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Demon Defense Force\Nwill need to shift strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, there's still much we lack,\Nincluding our enemy's stronghold location.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to do reconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuusetsu might be willing to\Ntalk since she's inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, she's only\Nappeared to me one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I declare a state\Nof emergency for Mato. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly does that entail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I reveal the Eight Thunder\NGods' existence to the public,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Demon Defense Force pours\Nall its efforts into defending them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll coordinate closely with\Nthe leaders of the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we calm everyone's fears by\Nrelaying our actions with humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Lady Wren.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight Thunder Gods are\Nnot to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to brush up on your abilities\Nin preparation for the imminent attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it in here because\Nyou're big and comfy cozy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The snag is a bug in a rug!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jouryuu, I need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Eight Thunder Gods have\Nbeen summoned for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shikoku, Jouryuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.47,0:13:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to greet us, Jakun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's my job as the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest are waiting inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.56,0:13:49.90,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,486.0)\an7\fs63}Eight Thunder Gods
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.56,0:13:49.90,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs63\pos(307.2,561.6)}Jakuun
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your research coming along well? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still much I want to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:14:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ordinarily, I'd be hard at\Nwork at this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for those Demon\NDefense Force pests!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you dodged that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you're moping, Lucky Rusty!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.98,0:14:30.44,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(153.6,334.8)}Eight Thunder Gods
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.98,0:14:30.44,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(288.0,410.4)}Naruhime
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, my anger is fueling my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I call a Thunder God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between the two of you, I'd say\NShikoku seems a bit more upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never should have let\NKusetsu go into battle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's annihilate those vile\Nhumans and avenge her death.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.23,0:14:57.19,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(153.6,648.0)}Eight Thunder Gods
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.23,0:14:57.19,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(307.2,723.6)}Fukuma
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.15,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1228.8,313.2)}Eight Thunder Gods
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.15,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1382.4,388.8)}Taikyoku
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Taikyoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a knee, Shikoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trusted in you to lead on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I cannot leave Mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The slaughter of a god is a\Nmassive failure on your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am horribly regretful with my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wounds will heal\Nshortly, unlike hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So revel in your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not dwell on the thought\Nof Kuusetsu any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, I have passed judgment upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of you are to chastise\Nher any further. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never did that in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taikyoku was the only one chastising her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,normally when the eight of\Nus are gathered together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have mounted an offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the plan, Shikoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The demon defense force is\Nstronger than I anticipated,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is why we should\Nrush the purification
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day like we had planned\Nfor after our attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we wait for purification\Nday, then it's open season.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.75,0:16:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our strength will increase dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeating the defense\Nforce will be even easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spineless approach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long does it take to\Nget our ducks in a row?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.69,0:16:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They annihilated one of our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should retaliate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with Naruhime and Rairen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.19,0:16:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then how about a compromise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We proceed with Shikoku's plan, and then\Nwe make a move on the Demon Defense Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Holy Tributes will attack them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.01,0:17:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Holy Tributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Former humans granted power by the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most capable of the holy\Ntributes becomes a thunder god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll jump at any chance\Nto prove themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She, too, desires godhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll see if she's strong\Nenough to stand beside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What say you, Lady Taikyoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not mind so long as\NShikoku is in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riren, Fukuma, the three of us\Nhave things to discuss later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you're\Nplanning something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as the humans like\Nto say, go big or go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, as we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother wishes for at least\N1,000 executions per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carry out your duties with that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make them fall to their knees\Nand bow down before our might.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.06,0:17:59.02,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1094.4,626.4)\an7}Demon Defense Force
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.06,0:17:59.02,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1132.8,702.0)}7th Squadron Dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A state of emergency for Mato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is starting to get pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight Thunder Gods are on the move,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they've already reached\Nhavoc on the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for us, things are changing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.47,0:18:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to become stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, stronger than ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, by expanding our\Nrespective abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then next, by enhancing my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be more\Nproactive about lending it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To you all, and other commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 7th Squadron is going to\Nget stronger alongside Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let the Thunder Gods scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make them fall and bow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the plan, Yuki, then\Nlet's practice after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himari, you've been keeping\NYuki all to yourself lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nii's ready to work hard. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll train with you whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name the time and place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.89,0:18:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's get going right now. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.79,0:18:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll take turns, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I get to go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to train you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.69,0:19:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You handled it very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Miss Kyoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Practicing with Mira, reuniting\Nwith Aoba, the commander's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have been hectic\Nsince beating Kusetsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they sure have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could drop\Nat any second. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the rest of the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an order as your commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you've had some decent rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think you'd want to\Nstart training with me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get as strong as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to surpass Commander Ren so\Nthat you can become Supreme Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kyouka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talking
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.77,0:20:15.02,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Love beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.19,0:20:28.85,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Shiritai teka shitai furetai
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.85,0:20:34.73,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Afuredasu kono omoi wa tomannai janai
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.73,0:20:41.35,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Amai amai sono karada de uketomete ne darling
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.35,0:20:44.73,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Kainarashite ageru gohoubi no jikan
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.94,0:20:49.56,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Kasaneawasu hada to hada kara umareru netsu de
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.69,0:20:52.52,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Juuden max
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.65,0:20:54.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Ima hassha OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm peace.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.90,0:20:58.02,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Kono te kara ima love love beam
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Undecu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one was in love, love, people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one was King of love,\Nlove, people! survivors.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.02,0:21:01.73,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Sono heart megake ima love love beam
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.73,0:21:05.56,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Kokoro no kyori mo tobikoeteku
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.56,0:21:07.69,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Zero kyori de hanate
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as I reach you, oh, love, people.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.69,0:21:09.19,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.19,0:21:12.65,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Nigasanai wa mou love love beam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.35,0:21:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the world about crib?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, love, people.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.65,0:21:16.27,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Sekai no hate mademo love love beam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,국민 of love, love, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, love, people.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.02,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Sou ai koso ga sekai o kaeru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The love will change the world, and the\Ndark will shine in the light of the dark.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.02,0:21:26.56,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fs63\blur3\fad(150,150)\an8}Kurayami mo somero heart iro ni
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.19,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1094.4,626.4)\an7}Demon Defense Force
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.19,Times New Roman,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(1132.8,702.0)}7th Squadron Dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supreme Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had some free time, so I stopped by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyouka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.67,0:21:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's with the First Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had some things to discuss with Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you in the middle of cooking? I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:21:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Commander\Neating a meal in our dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a bizarre sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the way she eats is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.35,0:22:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She ate every last bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.31,0:22:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.09,0:22:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dish that evokes the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.71,0:22:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, sit. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say sit, it means...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's a good boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.85,Balloon Bold BT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(710.4,162.0)\an7}Rub
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.85,Balloon Bold BT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1651.2,237.6)\an7}rub
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind the ears, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.63,0:22:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is happening right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the same at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Yuuki Wakura's in his\Nhuman form, it's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.99,0:23:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to discipline him after\Nhis slave transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.17,0:23:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, it doesn't count as\Npayback for what he did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.61,0:23:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Don't panic! There's\Na bonus! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad they didn't\Nget to see much of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved I didn't have\Nto do any special training!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a fierce battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect you all to do great things!

